{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Judgments are prepared for scoffers</b> — from HaShem, that is, HaShem will judge them because they scorn justice, and <b>and blows</b> are prepared, that the fools are struck by the hand of man, as in the matter of <i>and the rod for the back of fools</i>."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:44.204023062Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}